7IlsjtJZgU-fltA&oe=6AF87B3B"}, {"file_name": "G3.png", "id": "1119363793903091", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1119363797236424_8564680669278498477_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3qgXUsjp-lIQ7kNvwE3OWWP&_nc_oc=AdqO-4FtHWAByUPa3cNGLSsAKo3neHjI_6w744_14YJyVoFacRnuDLlxeeWRkFz7Y-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6I2lpnYoV3HknaaRGoVxcRl1T-NgQBNCrRFHh3ma5nQ&oe=6AF888DC"}, {"file_name": "QW.png", "id": "1810666740156825", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1810666743490158_1119238872664809119_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JEcsKaRTALMQ7kNvwGWyfDS&_nc_oc=Adr4XcvI3yz5n6oJEphqfz3dwzd_OENDRuEg7vktk063xGIv9ov5qfS_O2xOzcDNyXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJFwH_DOE2Axor7Yv-XZ8BzJVf5fLerpHnmh71YWjRlQ&oe=6AF8A7DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Turbo Horizon: Car Racing VR", "keywords": ["turbohorizon", "carracing", "speedx", "racinggame", "cargame"], "long_description": "Get ready for high-speed VR car racing! Turbo Horizon puts you behind the wheel for an immersive racing experience featuring high-quality visuals, realistic driving, and intense racing action.\n\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f High-Quality Racing Car\nTake control of a powerful racing car designed for an engaging VR driving experience. Feel the thrill of acceleration, control your speed, and push your driving skills to the limit.\n\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Exciting Racing Track\nRace across a carefully designed track filled with challenging corners and opportunities to build speed. Learn the track, improve your racing line, and aim for your fastest finish.\n\n\ud83e\udd7d Immersive VR Racing\nExperience racing from an engaging driver's perspective. Look around, feel closer to the action, and enjoy the excitement of driving in virtual reality.\n\n\u26a1 High-Speed Action\nHit the accelerator, watch your speedometer climb, and take on the track at high speed. Master corners, maintain control, and push for a faster finish.\n\n\u2728 High-Quality Visuals\nEnjoy a polished racing environment with detailed visuals created to deliver an immersive and engaging VR driving experience.\n\n### Features\n\n\u2022 VR car racing experience\n\u2022 1 high-quality racing car\n\u2022 1 exciting racing track\n\u2022 High-speed racing action\n\u2022 In-game speedometer\n\u2022 Immersive VR driving\n\u2022 High-quality visuals\n\u2022 Detailed racing environment\n\u2022 Fast-paced driving gameplay\n\nChoose your car. Hit the accelerator. Own the Horizon.\n\nPlay Turbo Horizon: Car Racing VR and experience the thrill of high-speed.", "short_description": "Turbo Horizon: Car Racing VR! Experience high-quality VR racing with one powerful car, one exciting track, immersive driving, realistic visuals, and intense high-speed action. Get ready to race, push your limits, and enjoy an engaging VR driving experience built for racing fans.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vision-edge-studio/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vision Edge Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vision-edge-studio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SIN